      "writtenOn": "2016-08-16T05:45:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "At the beginning, we selected automatic mode for SCI generation. Once FW put data in HIPMDO, hardware\u0027ll generate SCI signal if HIPMIE_SCIE bit is set. \n\nBut it seems automatic mode will cause problem if we need to issue SCI but FW didn\u0027t put any data in HIPMDO.\n\nPlease refer following steps for manual mode of SCI generating:\n1. make sure HIPMIE_SCIE bit is zero\n2. set ST1 bit of HIPMST in update_host_event_status\n2. set/clear SCIB bit of HIPMnIC manually in lpc_generate_sci.",
      "parentUuid": "7bd3b3eb_9b401742",
